36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:31,020 --> 00:01:35,150
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{When Time Stands Still</font>

38
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:38,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as the score isn't settled,</font>

39
00:01:38,990 --> 00:01:42,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the clock inside my heart will
remain stopped in the past!</font>

40
00:01:45,460 --> 00:01:48,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi, if you live
for revenge,</font>

41
00:01:48,250 --> 00:01:51,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your heart will sink
into darkness!</font>

42
00:01:51,090 --> 00:01:53,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it means that I am able
to carry out my revenge...</font>

43
00:01:54,460 --> 00:01:57,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care if my heart sinks
into darkness!</font>

44
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's exactly right.</font>

45
00:02:09,270 --> 00:02:11,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hold a grudge against you,
I hate you...</font>

46
00:02:11,810 --> 00:02:15,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My only purpose in living
has been to kill you...</font>

47
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

48
00:02:17,450 --> 00:02:18,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've...</font>

49
00:02:19,740 --> 00:02:20,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've survived!</font>

50
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:26,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm finished with messing around
with you Leaf Village guys.</font>

51
00:02:27,750 --> 00:02:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will go to Orochimaru!</font>

52
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't... let you go there...</font>

53
00:02:35,420 --> 00:02:36,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I cannot allow...</font>

54
00:02:37,510 --> 00:02:39,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you to go there!</font>

55
00:02:44,430 --> 00:02:47,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wasn't able to stop a comrade
who was sinking into darkness...</font>

56
00:02:47,770 --> 00:02:50,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, I won't let you go there,
no matter what!</font>

57
00:02:51,100 --> 00:02:52,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You pesky little...</font>

58
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:55,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you get in my way,
I'll consider you an enemy too!</font>

59
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way you guys
could ever understand!</font>

60
00:03:03,570 --> 00:03:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a trick device!</font>

61
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:13,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one can hinder my desire!</font>

62
00:03:19,010 --> 00:03:20,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?!</font>

63
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:22,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good!</font>

64
00:03:23,340 --> 00:03:24,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't get out!</font>

65
00:03:50,710 --> 00:03:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Farewell! Ninja of the Village Hidden
in the Leaves!</font>

66
00:03:55,710 --> 00:03:56,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lightning Blade!</font>

67
00:04:08,810 --> 00:04:09,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

68
00:04:19,110 --> 00:04:21,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How did you figure it out...?!</font>

69
00:04:26,410 --> 00:04:29,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I've seen your jutsu
with these very eyes...</font>

70
00:04:31,660 --> 00:04:33,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I remember now... You are...</font>

71
00:04:34,580 --> 00:04:36,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hatake... Kakashi...</font>

72
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:40,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Copy Ninja with
the Sharingan...</font>

73
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:43,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your jutsu doesn't even faintly mirror
that of Gaara's...</font>

74
00:04:44,590 --> 00:04:46,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've only scratched its surface.</font>

75
00:04:48,470 --> 00:04:50,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All you're doing is leaving
your main body elsewhere</font>

76
00:04:50,260 --> 00:04:53,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and using your chakra
to manipulate the rocks and sand...</font>

77
00:04:54,730 --> 00:04:56,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are nomads...</font>

78
00:04:56,810 --> 00:05:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">ridiculed as lower-ranked Shinobi
without a village...</font>

79
00:05:01,190 --> 00:05:06,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why we travel around the country,
stealing jutsu, sharpening our skills,</font>

80
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:10,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">struggling to one day find our way
into a place in the sun.</font>

81
00:05:10,990 --> 00:05:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But no matter how dedicated
our efforts are...</font>

82
00:05:14,290 --> 00:05:18,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to think there are dimensions
that cannot be transgressed...</font>

83
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:38,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the direction of
the feudal lord's palace...</font>

84
00:05:48,410 --> 00:05:51,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up! Lord Sagi's thought
to be buried beneath there!</font>

85
00:05:59,330 --> 00:06:02,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!
We really got screwed...</font>

86
00:06:03,340 --> 00:06:05,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That jerk!</font>

87
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:09,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a jerk... Give me a break!</font>

88
00:06:09,550 --> 00:06:10,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened...</font>

89
00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

90
00:06:14,220 --> 00:06:18,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sagi totally squashed us just now
and went off somewhere!</font>

91
00:06:18,890 --> 00:06:20,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me a break...
that guy's some kind of jerk!</font>

92
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:23,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't blame him for
the things he has done.</font>

93
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...!</font>

94
00:06:24,900 --> 00:06:28,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is himself,
but not himself right now.</font>

95
00:06:29,450 --> 00:06:31,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

96
00:06:31,490 --> 00:06:33,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is obsessed with avenging</font>

97
00:06:33,280 --> 00:06:35,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">his father and
younger sister's deaths.</font>

98
00:06:35,830 --> 00:06:41,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe he is possessed
by the ghost of the late Lord Owashi.</font>

99
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:45,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, come on... Stop joking...</font>

100
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:48,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not necessarily a joke.</font>

101
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:53,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it! That kind of thing gives me
the creeps!</font>

102
00:06:54,010 --> 00:06:57,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get a grip! This isn't the time to be
squabbling over things like that!</font>

103
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's important right now
is to find Sagi!</font>

104
00:07:00,810 --> 00:07:03,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we have no idea
where he went.</font>

105
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:05,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he is possessed,</font>

106
00:07:05,190 --> 00:07:07,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it is certain that
he will return to take revenge...</font>

107
00:07:08,610 --> 00:07:10,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And moreover... very soon...</font>

108
00:07:43,900 --> 00:07:49,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother... If I were to lose you too,
after having lost our father...</font>

109
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:53,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could not go on living...</font>

110
00:08:09,340 --> 00:08:11,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father... Elder Brother...</font>

111
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:14,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I shall join with you...</font>

112
00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:35,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother!</font>

113
00:08:56,510 --> 00:08:59,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother...
I will avenge this without fail...</font>

114
00:08:59,970 --> 00:09:02,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will once more restart
the hands of time for you, Elder Brother,</font>

115
00:09:02,470 --> 00:09:03,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">whose time was brought to a standstill...</font>

116
00:09:29,420 --> 00:09:31,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until the day that wish is realized...</font>

117
00:09:32,210 --> 00:09:36,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will live as you, Elder Brother,
as Sagi!</font>

118
00:10:30,810 --> 00:10:35,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sagi's temperament is such that
he will undoubtedly come here for Moso.</font>

119
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's actually quite convenient</font>

120
00:11:16,110 --> 00:11:18,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that Lord Sagi comes
all the way here to see me...</font>

121
00:11:19,610 --> 00:11:22,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I can't get my hands
on Sagi, the Feudal Lord,</font>

122
00:11:22,110 --> 00:11:25,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's not a crime to kill him
as the Cursed Warrior.</font>

123
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:29,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style: Fire Ball Jutsu!</font>

124
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:40,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a joke... A ghost appearing
in a child's toy...</font>

125
00:12:11,910 --> 00:12:13,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have some nerve appearing here
like this...</font>

126
00:12:13,580 --> 00:12:14,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cursed Warrior...</font>

127
00:12:19,210 --> 00:12:20,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi...</font>

128
00:12:21,380 --> 00:12:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you...?</font>

129
00:12:23,630 --> 00:12:25,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't you the high and mighty Moso?</font>

130
00:12:26,180 --> 00:12:27,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't answer to words like that</font>

131
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:29,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the likes of a ghost.</font>

132
00:12:29,970 --> 00:12:31,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn you!</font>

133
00:12:44,150 --> 00:12:45,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

134
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:48,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moso is just a fictitious name
used to deceive the world...</font>

135
00:12:49,370 --> 00:12:51,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Hoki...</font>

136
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:54,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The leader who heads
the Wandering Ninja...</font>

137
00:12:59,210 --> 00:13:02,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In place of not having a village,
we the Wandering Ninja</font>

138
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:06,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">steal jutsu from every village
we pass through and make them our own!</font>

139
00:13:09,180 --> 00:13:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But our family has tired of living
for so long as nomads.</font>

140
00:13:14,940 --> 00:13:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And we have been searching
for a land to call our home.</font>

141
00:13:19,610 --> 00:13:22,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. From the very start,
you came here to the Land of Birds</font>

142
00:13:22,530 --> 00:13:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the intention
of taking it over!</font>

143
00:13:24,610 --> 00:13:26,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way that
somebody like you,</font>

144
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">born destined to become a feudal lord,
could understand the suffering</font>

145
00:13:29,580 --> 00:13:33,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of Wandering Ninja
who do not have a homeland!</font>

146
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:36,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't see a problem</font>

147
00:13:36,420 --> 00:13:39,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the Wandering Ninja
seeking a safe homeland.</font>

148
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:45,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, your father was someone
who easily trusted others...</font>

149
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:47,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He never even suspected anything</font>

150
00:13:47,970 --> 00:13:50,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when I switched with the monk Moso,
highly reputed for his virtue,</font>

151
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:53,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and neared him...</font>

152
00:14:18,540 --> 00:14:20,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He misinterpreted
my Genjutsu of deception</font>

153
00:14:20,710 --> 00:14:24,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as being the holy power
of the virtuous Moso</font>

154
00:14:24,170 --> 00:14:26,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and put me on the fast track.</font>

155
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:31,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only person who suspected me
was Komei.</font>

156
00:14:32,970 --> 00:14:36,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I assassinated Owashi
and drove Komei away...</font>

157
00:14:37,810 --> 00:14:40,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk...
so it was you, after all!</font>

158
00:14:41,310 --> 00:14:44,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the last step is to kill you, Sagi.</font>

159
00:14:44,230 --> 00:14:46,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can do that, I will have accomplished
what I set out to do!</font>

160
00:14:47,110 --> 00:14:48,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk! I won't forgive you!</font>

161
00:14:49,070 --> 00:14:50,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Revenge for my clan!</font>

162
00:15:02,170 --> 00:15:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are...?!</font>

163
00:15:05,340 --> 00:15:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, that's right!</font>

164
00:15:08,050 --> 00:15:09,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Toki!</font>

165
00:15:11,300 --> 00:15:12,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Toki...!</font>

166
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:16,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will avenge my father
and brother's death!</font>

167
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession Jutsu!</font>

168
00:15:20,390 --> 00:15:24,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look at that, Toki...
Our shadows are overlapping, right...</font>

169
00:15:24,690 --> 00:15:26,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the Shadow Possession Jutsu!</font>

170
00:15:26,860 --> 00:15:28,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this, you won't be able
to move anymore!</font>

171
00:15:30,700 --> 00:15:33,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I wouldn't have imagined that
you would be the younger sister Toki...</font>

172
00:15:37,910 --> 00:15:41,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Wandering Ninja will be successful
in taking control of this land.</font>

173
00:15:42,670 --> 00:15:45,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will die as Sagi just
as you desire!</font>

174
00:15:48,590 --> 00:15:50,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Toki! Keep your composure!</font>

175
00:15:51,510 --> 00:15:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima...</font>

176
00:15:56,890 --> 00:15:58,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you were alive, huh...</font>

177
00:15:58,890 --> 00:16:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was unaware of your feelings, Lady Toki.</font>

178
00:16:01,390 --> 00:16:02,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima is most ashamed!</font>

179
00:16:03,770 --> 00:16:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this and die!</font>

180
00:16:09,070 --> 00:16:11,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I overheard everything just now.</font>

181
00:16:11,820 --> 00:16:15,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sagi, I mean, Toki!
Leave the rest to me!</font>

182
00:16:15,490 --> 00:16:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...?!</font>

183
00:16:16,910 --> 00:16:20,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not gonna happen!
You will die by your own shadow!</font>

184
00:16:20,250 --> 00:16:22,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The shadow has nothing to do with it!</font>

185
00:16:22,870 --> 00:16:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're just under the influence
of his Genjutsu!</font>

186
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:29,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

187
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:34,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Toki...</font>

188
00:16:34,180 --> 00:16:37,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession is
Shikamaru's Clan's Secret Jutsu!</font>

189
00:16:37,220 --> 00:16:40,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way you could
even hope to imitate it!</font>

190
00:16:40,470 --> 00:16:43,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only is your identity fake,
but your ninjutsu is too!</font>

191
00:16:44,270 --> 00:16:45,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the hell are you?!</font>

192
00:16:49,780 --> 00:16:50,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

193
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:54,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The heavens are watching your villainy!</font>

194
00:16:54,610 --> 00:16:56,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no way we will forgive you!</font>

195
00:16:57,700 --> 00:17:01,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why you Leaf Ninja...
But it's only a clone jutsu!</font>

196
00:17:02,290 --> 00:17:04,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style: Phoenix Flower Jutsu!</font>

197
00:17:09,250 --> 00:17:10,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They have substances?!</font>

198
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:12,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

199
00:17:13,420 --> 00:17:16,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke's Phoenix Flower Jutsu
is much more awesome!</font>

200
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:18,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my turn this time!</font>

201
00:17:18,930 --> 00:17:19,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn you!</font>

202
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:33,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hatake Kakashi...</font>

203
00:17:33,650 --> 00:17:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're here too, huh...</font>

204
00:17:35,780 --> 00:17:38,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hoki, the leader who heads
the Wandering Shinobi...</font>

205
00:17:39,070 --> 00:17:40,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've heard rumors about you.</font>

206
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:46,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're a Shinobi who wanders
from place to place like a bat...</font>

207
00:17:47,460 --> 00:17:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja from a rich village can't possibly
imagine circumstances like ours...</font>

208
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:54,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like hell I'll understand it...</font>

209
00:17:54,800 --> 00:17:58,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf are taught that the Way of Ninja
is to become a ninja who can endure...</font>

210
00:17:58,510 --> 00:18:02,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People like you who trick people
and wishfully try to seize land</font>

211
00:18:02,970 --> 00:18:05,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have no right to call themselves Shinobi!</font>

212
00:18:06,180 --> 00:18:07,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elitist!</font>

213
00:18:08,600 --> 00:18:09,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

214
00:18:20,910 --> 00:18:23,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! That's a real dragon!</font>

215
00:18:24,830 --> 00:18:25,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

216
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:38,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait...!</font>

217
00:18:39,890 --> 00:18:40,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

218
00:18:46,270 --> 00:18:47,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over there, huh?</font>

219
00:18:56,820 --> 00:18:58,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with that?</font>

220
00:19:04,790 --> 00:19:06,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the Summoning Dragons
were fake too...</font>

221
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:09,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He fled off somewhere...</font>

222
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:13,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inside the mansion!</font>

223
00:19:13,130 --> 00:19:14,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not letting him get away!</font>

224
00:19:26,810 --> 00:19:28,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

225
00:19:38,820 --> 00:19:40,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you... wait!</font>

226
00:19:44,910 --> 00:19:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did he vanish to?!</font>

227
00:19:48,370 --> 00:19:50,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Leaf Ninja...</font>

228
00:19:58,960 --> 00:20:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

229
00:20:00,670 --> 00:20:04,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want to have Toki back,
come over here...</font>

230
00:20:04,140 --> 00:20:05,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How?!</font>

231
00:20:11,310 --> 00:20:13,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take that boat to come over here...</font>

232
00:20:13,850 --> 00:20:14,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genjutsu?</font>

233
00:20:14,980 --> 00:20:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you scared,
you Leaf apprentice ninja?</font>

234
00:20:19,570 --> 00:20:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not an apprentice!</font>

235
00:20:33,790 --> 00:20:35,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This place... don't tell me it's...</font>

236
00:20:41,010 --> 00:20:41,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?</font>

237
00:21:20,320 --> 00:21:23,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>kaze ga fuite aa</b></font></font></font>

