<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>bouken kichijitsu shinpaku joushou</b></font></font></font>

272
00:22:24,990 --> 00:22:27,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>adventure, lucky day, geart beat, rising</b></font></font></font>

273
00:22:27,820 --> 00:22:32,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>meian souguu seimei souai</b></font></font></font>

274
00:22:27,820 --> 00:22:32,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>decisive, encounter, life, mutual love</b></font></font></font>

275
00:22:39,330 --> 00:22:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Chishima...</font>

276
00:22:41,630 --> 00:22:43,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">believed in you
until the very end.</font>

277
00:22:44,300 --> 00:22:47,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">He truly loved this land...</font>

278
00:22:47,340 --> 00:22:50,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">and he worried about his friends
from the bottom of his heart!</font>

279
00:22:50,930 --> 00:22:52,220
